{
  "dn22:0.1": "Dīgha Nikāya 22 ",
  "dn22:0.2": "Mahāsatipaṭṭhānasutta ",
  "dn22:1.1": "Evaṁ me sutaṁ—",
  "dn22:1.2": "ekaṁ samayaṁ bhagavā kurūsu viharati kammāsadhammaṁ nāma kurūnaṁ nigamo. ",
  "dn22:1.3": "Tatra kho bhagavā bhikkhū āmantesi: ",
  "dn22:1.4": "“bhikkhavo”ti. ",
  "dn22:1.5": "“Bhaddante”ti te bhikkhū bhagavato paccassosuṁ. ",
  "dn22:1.6": "Bhagavā etadavoca: ",
  "dn22:1.7": "“Ekāyano ayaṁ, bhikkhave, maggo sattānaṁ visuddhiyā, sokaparidevānaṁ samatikkamāya dukkhadomanassānaṁ atthaṅgamāya ñāyassa adhigamāya nibbānassa sacchikiriyāya, yadidaṁ cattāro satipaṭṭhānā. ",
  "dn22:1.8": "Katame cattāro? ",
  "dn22:1.9": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu kāye kāyānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ, ",
  "dn22:1.10": "vedanāsu vedanānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ, ",
  "dn22:1.11": "citte cittānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ, ",
  "dn22:1.12": "dhammesu dhammānupassī viharati ātāpī sampajāno satimā vineyya loke abhijjhādomanassaṁ. ",
  "dn22:1.13": "Uddeso niṭṭhito. ",
  "dn22:2.0.1": "1. Kāyānupassanā ",
  "dn22:2.0.2": "1.1. Kāyānupassanāānāpānapabba ",
  "dn22:2.1": "Kathañca pana, bhikkhave, bhikkhu kāye kāyānupassī viharati? ",
  "dn22:2.2": "Idha, bhikkhave, bhikkhu araññagato vā rukkhamūlagato vā suññāgāragato vā nisīdati pallaṅkaṁ